# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-monas00-0 = 
    如今你立于城中修道院之前。身着褐袍的修士们在院中忙碌，或侍弄小园，或匆匆赶往小教堂祈祷，或只是悠然漫步。<br><p><x19>你决定……<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>请求研读修道院藏书楼中的圣典与书籍，以增进宗教修养及拉丁语学识。<br><p><opt>...<indent>支付费用，让修士为你诵经祈福，从而赢得神恩。<br><opt>...<indent>this option should be hidden<br><opt>...<indent>this option should be hidden<br><opt>...<indent>this option should be hidden<br><opt>...<indent>this option should be hidden<br><p><opt>...<indent>离开修道院。
msg-monas00-1 = 
    Studying diligently, $ChosenOneName pores through the ancient tomes. However, the language used is too difficult for $him to make out much of the sense. After many hours of toil, $he gives up.{" "}
msg-monas00-2 = 
    Reading book after book, $ChosenOneName learns a great deal about the nature and philosophy of religion, and about the spiritual world. $He also learns several new terms and phrases of vulgate Latin, as used by the church.{" "}
msg-monas00-3 = 
    修道院院长拒你近书。“虽处幽闭，然耳闻汝名。所闻之事，并未令吾等确信珍籍可托。”
msg-monas00-4 = 
    经过深思熟虑，你……<br><opt>...<indent>this option should be hidden<br><opt>...<indent>this option should be hidden<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>给修士一枚佛罗林。<br><p><opt>...<indent>给修士三枚佛罗林。<br><p><opt>...<indent>给修士六枚佛罗林。<br><p><opt>...<indent>给修士十枚佛罗林。<br><p><opt>...<indent>改念，决定终究不为弥撒付费。
msg-monas00-5 = 
    方丈收下了你的钱。“请放心，善人啊，$monastery的僧侣们必将以满腔热忱为你诵念圣咏。”
